    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but it honestly feels useless. it’s just the same pattern. the guilt, the relapse, the shame... it just repeats and repeats. it’s like eventually the only way to actually break a loop that never ends is to just stop being part of it. it feels so heavy.",
